        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-27T18:40:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>How should I entertain myself while waiting for my copy of the game to get here?</p><p>background: I played the game once (well, twice in one sitting) and just got addicted to it right away and HAD to order it as soon as i got home</p><p>So the shipping tracker says it'll be here in another 5 days still.... (holidays and weekends making it longer than usual...)</p><p>I've spent the past couple days already just:</p><p>* reading (and rereading) the online rulebooks</p><p>* reading the comic</p><p>* going through the forums (or at least the forum topics that i would find personally interesting).</p><p>I am now at the point of chewing on the furniture as i keep hitting refresh on the shipping tracker every hour even though their database is clearly not updated that frequently ;-)</p><p>What else is a person to do to satiate his craving for SotM while waiting for his fix to arrive? ;)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:05.275Z",
